/*
 * Implements semantic validation for field access on slice values in Ymir.
 *
 * Supported fields:
 *   - len   — number of elements in the slice
 *   - ptr   — pointer to the first element of the slice
 *
 * This module is invoked by FieldValidation when the left operand is a SliceType.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::fields::slice
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/fields/slice.yr
